sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Q as Redis queue
    participant W as Celery worker
    participant M as Ollama (warm)
    participant ML as MLflow
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/forecast/predict {symbol}
    API->>Q: Enqueue task
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted {task_id}
    Q->>W: Deliver task
    W->>W: OHLCV → 10x10 decile tokens
    W->>M: Symbolic sequence
    M-->>W: Next token
    W->>W: LSTM shadow prediction
    W->>ML: Log is_divergent
    loop Every few seconds
        UI->>API: GET task status
    end
    API-->>UI: {prediction, confidence, divergence}
